   },
   {
    "area": "data",
    "id": "L2",
    "text": "No annotation files, verified conflict labels, verified events or independent scene groups exist: independent evaluation is blocked."
   },
   {
    "area": "coordinates",
    "id": "L3",
    "text": "Image-space pixels only; the camera moves; no ego-motion compensation, no metric geometry, no TTC/PET/distance/severity."
   },
   {
    "area": "streaming",
    "id": "L4",
    "text": "The window builder accepts a window only if the target also has its 15 future samples, so windows (and alerts) are conditioned on future track existence; the pipeline is an offline replay, not a causal online system. Inference inputs themselves are history-only (verified by future-scrambling)."
   },
   {
    "area": "perception",
    "id": "L5",
    "text": "Video decoding and detection/tracking were not executed in this environment (no raw video, no OpenCV/Ultralytics, no GPU); Phase 3 results are recorded from the Colab T4 run."
   },
   {
    "area": "provenance",
    "id": "L6",
    "text": "The Phase 5 model verifies the exact window-run manifest hash; regenerating windows creates a new manifest, so the model rejects them (by design). Re-execution is therefore checked for data-file equality and inference uses the reference window run."
   },
   {
    "area": "performance",
    "id": "L7",
    "text": "CPU-only, one machine; peak memory is the process peak working set; no GPU, no end-to-end real-time measurement."
   },
   {
    "area": "calibration",
    "id": "L8",
    "text": "Phase 7 probabilities are null; categories and Phase 8 thresholds are unvalidated engineering configuration."
   },
   {
    "area": "alerts",
    "id": "L9",
    "text": "Alerts are properties of a heuristic on one in-sample video; most close by evidence loss (pair no longer observed), not by risk subsiding."
   }
  ],
